{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/450851-can-contract-of-dream-2-be-used-for-oneiromancy","id":450851,"title":"Can Contract of Dream 2 be used for Oneiromancy?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-20T14:11:19-07:00","id":450851,"title":"Can Contract of Dream 2 be used for Oneiromancy?","content":"If you use Contract of Dream 2 to give someone a particular dream, can it have the same effect as Oneiromancy (Healing Dream, etc)? Can they use this contract to observe someone's dreams? They can apparently enter Dream Combat if they are trying to alter someone's dream when another Changeling is in it.<br /> <br /> If you are an Oneirophysic, can you use Dream 2 to perform surgery once you are rank 2?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","user":"SoulGambit","date":". 03-20-2015, 05:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T15:58:48-07:00","id":450961,"title":"","content":"The Contract of Dreams, and Clause 2 in particular, is one of my group's sorest points when it comes to the core book. Only two Clauses have anything to do with Oneiromancy, and the first one doesn't actually seem like it was written by someone who had read the Oneiromancy rules.<br /> <br /> Hence the answer to the question is... up to you? As written, you could probably argue that all it does is allow you to change the aesthetics of the dream. Beyond that, it's hard to tell. It doesn't make any reference to the Oneiromancy mechanics in the core book, let alone expansion material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T18:19:26-07:00","id":451130,"title":"","content":"I read a lot of the Dream contracts as being shortcuts for stuff that regular oneiromancy can do with more effort. It allows you to get into dreams without having to be in the Hedge, without a dream protection pledge, etc.<br /> <br /> My books are in another country, so I can't check on the minutae. That's how I always interpreted it, I think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4722-birnam","name":"Birnam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T16:02:39-07:00","id":454972,"title":"","content":"What I do with Clause 2 in my group is just make it put the changeling in the subject's dreams and then let them use Oneiromancy however they like. It makes the power more useful, more clear, and gives much better access to dreams which are a very interesting part of the setting. Like Asahul says, I suspect whoever wrote the Contract of Dreams didn't have access to the Oneiromancy material at the time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4692-helel","name":"helel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"141"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T17:19:41-07:00","id":455045,"title":"","content":"I assume Dream 2 can be used for Orniromancy. It makes it easier than the default, free ability all Changelings have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link